{
  "name": "UMKM 01 — Auto-Reply WhatsApp (Keyword Bot)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "wa-incoming",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Incoming WhatsApp Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ],
      "webhookId": "WhatsApp-masuk-umkm",
      "notes": "Di dashboard Fonnte set webhook ke URL ini so that message WhatsApp masuk diteruskan ke n8n.",
      "notesInFlow": false
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "nomor_wa",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.sender || $json.sender || $json.query.sender }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "pesan_masuk",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message || $json.message || $json.query.message }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "chat_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.sender || $json.sender || $json.query.sender }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "norm",
      "name": "Read Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        320
      ],
      "notes": "Fonnte mengirim field \"sender\" (number WA) dan \"message\" (isi message).",
      "notesInFlow": false
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s1",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message }}",
                    "rightValue": "hello|hi|hey|morning|afternoon|evening|night|assalamualaikum",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "matchesRegex"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "sapaan"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s2",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message }}",
                    "rightValue": "price|harga|how much|cost|rate|list",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "matchesRegex"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "harga"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s3",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message }}",
                    "rightValue": "hour|open|close|operational|when",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "matchesRegex"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "jam"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s4",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message }}",
                    "rightValue": "address|location|where|maps|office|store",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "matchesRegex"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "alamat"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s5",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message }}",
                    "rightValue": "order|pesan|buy|booking|reservation|send",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "matchesRegex"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "order"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "s6",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.message }}",
                    "rightValue": "admin|manusia|cs|ask|komplain|masalah",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "matchesRegex"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              },
              "outputKey": "admin"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "lainnya"
        }
      },
      "id": "switch",
      "name": "Detect Intent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        680,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "name": "balasan",
              "value": "=Halo {{ $json.name }}! 👋\n\nWelcome to *[YOUR STORE NAME]*\n\nI am a virtual assistant, here to help 24 hours.\n\nType:\n• *price* — see the price list\n• *hour* — opening hours\n• *address* — store location\n• *order* — how to order\n• *admin* — talk to our team",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-sapaan",
      "name": "Reply Greeting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b2",
              "name": "balasan",
              "value": "=💰 *PRICE LIST*\n\n📦 Product A — Rp 50.000\n📦 Product B — Rp 75.000\n📦 Product C — Rp 100.000\n\n_(Edit this list to match your products)_\n\nType *order* to start an order, or *admin* to ask questions first.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-harga",
      "name": "Reply Price",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b3",
              "name": "balasan",
              "value": "=🕐 *OPENING HOURS*\n\nMonday – Friday: 08.00 – 17.00\nSaturday: 08.00 – 15.00\nSunday & public holidays: Closed\n\n_(Edit these to match your store hours)_",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-jam",
      "name": "Reply Opening Hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b4",
              "name": "balasan",
              "value": "=📍 *OUR LOCATION*\n\n[YOUR STORE NAME]\nJl. Example Address No. 123\nDistrict, Your City\n\nGoogle Maps: https://maps.google.com/?q=YOUR_ADDRESS\n\n_(Edit this address)_",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-alamat",
      "name": "Reply Address",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b5",
              "name": "balasan",
              "value": "=🛒 *HOW TO ORDER*\n\n1. Type the product you want\n2. Send your full name\n3. Send your delivery address\n4. Our team confirms and sends a payment link\n\nEstimated delivery: 1-3 working days.\n\nOr type *admin* if you want direct assistance.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-order",
      "name": "Reply Order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b6",
              "name": "balasan",
              "value": "=Sure {{ $json.name }}, I will connect you to our team. 🙏\n\nOur team replies during working hours (08:00-17:00 WIB).\n\nIf it is urgent, contact us directly:\n📞 08xx-xxxx-xxxx\n📧 email@tokoanda.com\n\n_(Edit these contacts)_",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-admin",
      "name": "Reply Contact Admin",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        620
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b7",
              "name": "balasan",
              "value": "=Sorry {{ $json.name }}, I did not quite understand that. 🤔\n\nI can help with:\n• *price* — list price\n• *hour* — opening hours\n• *address* — store location\n• *order* — how to order\n• *admin* — contact our team\n\nTry typing one of those.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r-lain",
      "name": "Reply Not Understood",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.fonnte.com/send",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "REPLACE_FONNTE_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "target",
              "value": "={{ $json.nomor_wa }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.reply }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "kirim",
      "name": "Send Reply (WhatsApp)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1180,
        400
      ],
      "notes": "Token Fonnte from dashboard fonnte.com -> Device -> Token. Ganti REPLACE_FONNTE_TOKEN.",
      "notesInFlow": false
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## UMKM 01 — Auto-Reply Bot\n\n**Good for:** online shops, services, food businesses, laundries, workshops, salons.\n\n**What the client must edit:**\n- Store name\n- Price list\n- Opening hours\n- Address + Google Maps\n- Admin contact\n\nAll of it sits in the *Reply ...* nodes — just replace the text.\n\n**Upgrade to AI:**\nAdd an *AI Agent* node + *Groq/Gemini* (free) so it can answer open questions instead of only keywords.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        80
      ]
    }
